{
  "description": "E147 s0: one well-formed change to one file of a valid fixture per case (fixtures/valid/<base>/<file>), everything else left valid; the check names exactly `code` in the file `at` at the JSON path `path` (null: the file as a whole). `set` puts a value at a key path (an index one past the end appends), `delete` removes one, `raw` replaces the file's bytes, `raw_replace` replaces the first occurrence of a text with another. Layer `contract`: descriptors.py decides it from the manifest and the descriptors' bytes (validate_citation, parse, compare; verify runs all three). Layer `reader`: the bundle reader decides it before parsing (E147 s0 C2): `remove` the file; `reader` makes it a link (`link`), a directory (`directory`), larger than MAX_FILE_BYTES (`over-file-limit`) or the file that takes the bundle over MAX_TOTAL_BYTES (`over-total`). Layer `starter` (E147 s3): descriptors.py decides it from a starter pack's starter.json, the record in its evidence.json and the descriptors' bytes (verify_starter); the files of the pack are the SDK's. Layer `episodes` (E160 s0): descriptors.py decides it from a work-episodes folder's trajectories.json bytes and its croissant.json (verify_episodes); the folder's other files are the SDK's. Every code of descriptors.py CODES and READER_CODES has a case.",
